WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.344
I measure two kinds of time: the hands’ time and the flowers’ time.

00:00:03.524 --> 00:00:06.380
Timișoara’s floral clock dates from the seventies.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:12.620
My replica moves here, while the place outside continues its story through gardening and plans for its restoration.
